  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0EVH">Example <span data-tag="0EVH">38.37.11</span>.</a> Let $A$ be a ring. Let $f_1, f_2 \in A$ be elements. </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{ E = \text{Proj}(A/(f_1, f_2)[T_0, T_1]) \ar[r] \ar[d] &  \text{Proj}(A[T_0, T_1]/(f_2 T_0 - f_1 T_1) = X' \ar[d] \\  Z = \mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(A/(f_1, f_2)) \ar[r] &  \mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(A) = X }  \]
</div>
  <p> is an almost blowup square. </p>
